      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "how do we make a good financial portfolio?\nlets start with protection\nlife is uncertain and u need insurance so it doesnt eat up ur savings which was for ur goals\nafter this black hole is closed than we can start building wealth\nu have some pre planned expenses and ur other dreams, each has different timetable\nso each requires different instruments to achieve them",
